	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Use BoltAI from Alfred. Every action goes through BoltAI's `bolt` command-line tool, so BoltAI does the work with your own providers, models and AI Workflows.

Keywords (change them in Configure Workflow):
• ask &lt;question&gt;: one-off answer from your default model, copied to the clipboard.
• bolt [message]: new chat in BoltAI; with a message, it is sent.
• workflow: run an AI Workflow or Multi-step Workflow on the clipboard. ↵ pastes the result, ⌘ copies it, ⌥ opens the workflow in BoltAI.
• prompts: paste a saved prompt (⌘ copies it).

Universal Action: select text, open Universal Actions and choose Run BoltAI Workflow to run a workflow on the selection.

Needs a BoltAI version that includes the bolt tool. The workflow finds it in ~/.local/bin, /Applications/BoltAI.app or the Setapp app; set the bolt path if BoltAI is somewhere else.</string>
